WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.480
As you can imagine, here in Los Angeles

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:05.120
businesses and public spaces
have continued to stay open

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:08.380
despite a record number
of coronavirus cases.

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:09.710
Some people are leaving their homes,

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:11.810
others aren't so sure that's a good idea.

00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:14.230
You know, I'm in a new neighborhood now

00:00:14.230 --> 00:00:15.330
right here in Hollywood.

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:17.910
I thought I'd simply take a look,

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:20.150
check and see what it's like outside

00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:21.730
and then make the call for myself.

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:24.240
So I'm just gonna quickly
look out the stage door

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:25.453
and see if it's safe.

00:00:28.352 --> 00:00:29.185
Here we go.

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:33.400
Check things out.

00:00:34.326 --> 00:00:36.826
(tense music)

00:00:43.593 --> 00:00:46.426
(moaning)

00:00:46.426 --> 00:00:49.009
(bees buzzing)

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:57.329
(screaming and glass shattering)

00:00:57.329 --> 00:00:59.746
(explosions)

00:01:09.654 --> 00:01:11.737
Needs a little more time.

